        "text": "The photo was taken while I was walking toward the House Chamber on the east side of the Capitol.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Demonstrators were positioned behind police barricades on the plaza outside the Capitol.",
        "confidence": 0.96
