  {
    "episode_id": 66467,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/6/66467.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 148,
    "turn_text": "So what is the likelihood of that? Because as you know, I think it's 49, maybe up to 15, last I'd like those 49 states are suing Facebook in an antitrust case. And there is a bill introduced by Amy Klobuchar too, on the other side of the aisle, trying to attack this problem. You and she are not that far apart on this issue. There could be some bipartisanship if you weren't so toxic. And what do you think is actually going to happen? Because it seems like the mood might be shifting a little toward doing something about how big they are and how powerful they are.",
