        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Many proposed reforms seek to reintroduce 'good faith' requirements into all sections of the statute to mandate justification for each takedown decision.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Platforms should be required to strictly adhere to their own published terms of service.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "If platforms fail to comply with their own terms of service, they should face legal liability.",
